.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
.Dd October 30, 2026
.Dt BENEXT.JSON 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm benext.json
.Nd benext configuration file
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Strict JSON (RFC 8259) object.
Unknown keys are errors.
.Bl -tag -width "reboot_cmd"
.It Va checks_dir
Absolute path of the health-check directory.
Default
.Pa /etc/benext.d .
.It Va keep
Integer 0\(en50: fallback boot environments kept by
.Cm prune .
Default 3.
.It Va reboot_cmd
Command run when a boot is unhealthy.
Default
.Dq shutdown -r now .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Pa /etc/benext/config.json
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr benext 8
